{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U4ujcp_8ccGPuyf4DBGVFQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:08.892453+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U4ujcp_8ccGPuyf4DBGVFQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9z8rnGEgaarqqjGf76nkQmibc2orPXNVNbrVtITOusR8694P5oiatPbaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进全国优秀大学生交流，让广大学子深入了解我校基础医学学科情况，我院搭建平台拟举办2025年度全国优秀大学生暑期线上夏令营活动，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院基本情况</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>华中科技大学基础医学院，源自1907年德国医生埃里希·宝隆博士在上海创办的德文医学堂，1950年内迁武汉，历经百年发展，现已成为我国医学教育的重要基地。学院依托基础医学国家“双一流”建设学科，拥有首批基础医学国家级实验教学示范中心，致力于培养具有全球竞争力的高层次研究型创新人才。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院围绕脑医学、药物药理学、代谢与肿瘤、免疫与病原生物、细胞医学五个特色培养方向，形成了鲜明的研究特色。近五年，学院承担国家级科研项目219项，总经费达2.42亿元，发表高水平学术论文807篇，其中包括《Nature》、《Science》、《Cell》等顶尖期刊论文177篇，在多个领域树立国际学术标签。目前，学院参与建设了人畜共患传染病重症诊治全国重点实验室等多个国家级和省部级重点实验室，拥有基础医学国家级实验教学示范中心及精准医学测试中心等公共科研平台，设备总值达2.78亿元，科研实验室总面积超过8000平方米。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院在研究生培养环节推行国际一流的科研训练，注重厚基础、重实践。通过学术训练、教学实践和社会实践，提升学生的科研创新能力和学科交叉能力；通过设置多维奖助学金体系，在读研究生的资助率达到100%。近5年,本学位点邀请公开学术报告256次（年均51.2次），资助研究生参加国内外会议732人次，公开报告100余次，获学术奖励共计30人次，各类媒体相关报道共计100余次，多位同学荣获国家自然科学基金青年学生基础研究项目（博士研究生）资助，荣获中国科协青年人才托举工程博士生专项计划。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>近三年，学院研究生就业率保持在90%以上，主要签约单位为医疗卫生单位、高等教育单位、机关事业单位以及头部医药企业，就业地域覆盖全国，部分毕业生选择赴国外发展，许多优秀毕业生已成为所在单位的业务骨干，用人单位对学院毕业生满意度高。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1．2025年6月6日至6月28日接收申请材料。</span></p><p><span>2．2025年6月29日至7月1日审核材料，发入营通知。</span></p><p><span>3．2025年7月3日—4日（如有变动另行通知，请关注基础医学院网站）通过网络会议举行线上夏令营。主要的内容包括：开营仪式、基础医学院各专业研究方向介绍、各专业研究方向组织线上交流。夏令营不收取报名费。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 基础医学、生物学、临床医学、药学、制药工程、生物医学工程、材料工程、生物工程、生物医学工程、中西医结合、计算机、物理、化学等相关专业2026届本科应届毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 诚实守信，学风端正，无学业学术行为不端记录，动手能力强，能达到所在高校推荐免试生要求者优先。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 本科阶段总成绩排名在该校同年级本专业排名中名列前茅。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.《华中科技大学基础医学院2025年暑期夏令营申请表》1份（见附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．个人简历1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 本科阶段成绩单（由教务部门盖章）1份，有条件的可提供院系或导师推荐意见（见附件2）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 获奖及各类证书扫描文件各1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现英语水平的证明1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6．体现自身学术水平的代表性论文、出版物或原创性工作成果（如专利、发明、制作、软件等）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间及方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1．申请者于6月28日24点前填写基础医学院2025年暑期学术夏令营报名表，报名表链接为：https://www.wjx.cn/vm/eHqU2yk.aspx#</span></span></p><p><span><span>或者用手机</span><strong><span>微信扫二维码</span></strong><span>填写报名表</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9oSdQ1L9q3n7KHyAubtytCFhacs5axf3MWS1tdTGjaydHIbdr6jVn0A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2. 请申请者务必于6月28日24点前加入2025基础夏令营QQ咨询群，群号为703479346。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>填表注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1．拟申请的研究方向一项指的是计划报考或申请推免专业方向。请从以下专业方向中选择：脑医学、药物药理学、代谢与肿瘤、免疫与病原生物、细胞医学。基础医学院将参考报名学生的拟申请专业方向和感兴趣的课题组安排分组。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2．年级排名一项指的是大学三年期间的专业或年级排名，不能确定的可以填写大致排名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3．免推资格一项指的是根据大学三年期间的专业或年级排名，以及本学院历年的免推政策所确定的是否具有保送校内或校外的免试推荐资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4．报名者所提供的各种信息和材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，将取消报名人所获得的相关资格。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s9CALTsqvbHeZDFKL8wic91wqJEeAXX5QRZRvrKGSzwmZd7PCd9StPzgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong><span>：吴老师、肖老师</span></p><p><strong><span>网址：</span></strong><span>http://jcyxy.tjmu.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>联系电话： </span></strong><span>027-83692627 / 027-83857467</span></p><p><strong><span>QQ群：</span></strong><span>703479346</span></p><p><strong><span>Email：</span></strong><span> hkjcyxytj@163.com</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>附件1、附件2 下载链接：</span></b><span><span>http://jcyxy.tjmu.edu.cn/info/1573/9257.htm</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/wDEzTNHJx6HVhvCYu0upqZ05Gh2WS6s988rs7ib1KnLcGOcCTwKvcujqXFg8OcPCk0oW7XZQQicO2AYibqibT6crzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"adada7b80a52b1dab100aef1147fa5514c1fab534434ab1575af30ee24176275","textLength":1953,"sourceSha256":"ea9fec67c02badd844a9b3b6925528412f4b3d7c6508ac7dc16f98aad77037bf","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f63d996ed2e3710ddac8","title":"2025年华中科技大学同济医学院基础医学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:08.892453+00:00"}
